@host = http://localhost:8080
@facilityKey = demo-clinic-key
@patientId = patient-001

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### Facility creates an appointment
POST {{host}}/api/v1/integration/appointments
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{facilityKey}}

{
  "externalAppointmentId": "visit-001",
  "externalPatientId": "{{patientId}}",
  "scheduledAt": "2026-12-10T10:00:00Z",
  "consultationReason": "Recurring headache"
}

### Facility dashboard
GET {{host}}/api/v1/integration/appointments
X-Api-Key: {{facilityKey}}

### Patient history
GET {{host}}/api/v1/patient/appointments
X-Patient-Id: {{patientId}}

### Replace after creating an appointment
@appointmentId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

POST {{host}}/api/v1/patient/appointments/{{appointmentId}}/answers
Content-Type: application/json
X-Patient-Id: {{patientId}}

{
  "question": "What is the main reason for your consultation?",
  "answer": "A headache that returns in the afternoon.",
  "mode": "Text"
}
